pan></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish%20Fin\"><img alt=\"Fish Fin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fish_Fin_1c9ced.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Life Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Ring_d8e154.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\"><img alt=\"Small Emerald\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Emerald_279b08.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Water elemental\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"76\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Water_elemental_56e146.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>A new aqueous grotto has been discovered situated in the southern part of <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>. The cave is almost fully enveloped by water. The main floor consists mainly of <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Elemental\">Water Elementals</a> who strive in the wet conditions.\n</p><p>There are 5 accessable <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Channel\">Water Channels</a> throughout the cave that give access to deeper, more dangerous areas. It is required to wear Diving Equipment to access these channels. Be careful! The deeper portions of the cave are inhabited by <a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Water%20Elemental\">Massive Water Elementals</a>.\n</p><p>It is also wise to bring along a <a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a>, as Water Elementals have a high-hitting Drown Damage-based attack. If you are a sorcerer or druid, wearing a Glacier Set (save for the mask) is also a good idea, as they have an <a href=\"#/wiki/Icicle\">Icicle</a>-resembling distance attack. \n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> will have trouble hunting in this area, because Water Elementals are strong to physical damage. An Energy-enchanted weapon might help, but in general this area is only hunted by mages, and paladins to a lesser extent. <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> can try running them with royal spears (may take a while to kill them), or equip a bow and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Flash%20Arrow\">Flash Arrows</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a> can easily dispatch them with <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Strike\">Energy Strike</a> and an appropriate wand or rod.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Main_Floor\">Main Floor</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Elemental\"><img alt=\"Water Elemental\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Water_Elemental_4d70e0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Elemental\">Water Elemental</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">650</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">550</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">563 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">165 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">150 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ice Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_68a15e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">13 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\"